Matthias J. Sax created KAFKA-16337:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: Remove Deprecates APIs of Kafka Streams in 5.0
                 Key: KAFKA-16337
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16337
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
          Components: streams, streams-test-utils
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax
             Fix For: 5.0.0


This is an umbrella ticket that tries to collect all APIs under Kafka Streams that were deprecated in 3.6 or later. When the release scheduled for 5.0 will be set, we might need to remove sub-tasks if they don't hit the 1-year threshold.

Each subtask will de focusing on a specific API, so it's easy to discuss if it should be removed by 5.0.0 or maybe even at a later point.



--
