Hi Jun,

> So, for an application to switch from the 2PC option to the non-2PC
option, is it just a config change or does the application code need to be
changed?

If an application is written to work in 2PC mode (Flink is an example of
such an application), then the config change can be used to switch between
"2PC with full guarantees" mode and "it mostly works, but with timeout"
mode.  Application changes are not needed, it'll just work in both modes
with the expected semantics.

-Artem

