> >      public static final String WINDOW_SIZE_MS_CONFIG =3D "window.size.=
ms
> ";
> > }
> >
> >
> >
> > -Matthias
> >
> >
> > On 2/15/24 6:32 AM, Lucia Cerchie wrote:
