rns the value in right-topic.

=C2=A0

+*Scenario1: change foreignKey*+

Input the following
{code:scala}
rightTopic.pipeInput("fk1", "1")
rightTopic.pipeInput("fk2", "2")=20

leftTopic.pipeInput("pk1", LeftRecord("fk1", "pk1"))
leftTopic.pipeInput("pk1", LeftRecord("fk2", "pk1"))
{code}
=C2=A0

*+Expected result+*
{code:scala}
KeyValue(pk1, 1)
KeyValue(pk1, 2){code}
=C2=A0

*+Actual result+*
{code:scala}
KeyValue(pk1, 1)
KeyValue(pk1, null)
KeyValue(pk1, 2){code}
=C2=A0

A null is propagated to the join result when the foreign key changes

=C2=A0

+*Scenario 2: Delete PrimaryKey*+

Input
{code:scala}
