--------------------------------------

             Summary: Use NetworkClientTest to replace RequestResponseTest to be the example of log4j output
                 Key: KAFKA-16416
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16416
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai


https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/trunk/README.md#running-a-particular-unitintegration-test-with-log4j-output

`RequestResponseTest` does not produce log4j output even though we set the log level to info, so it could misdirect users. Hence, we should use another test class which can produce log output to replace `RequestResponseTest`. For example: NetworkClientTest



