ail.com>
> wrote:
>
> > Hi Sanaa,
> > in KRaft mode there is the role of "observer" which is typically taken =
by
> > brokers as part of the data plane. The broker/observer can discover whi=
ch
> > node is the leader/active controller and fetches the metadata from it (=
as
> > the "followers" in the KRaft quorum), but cannot vote and cannot become
> > leader.
> > AFAIK it's allowing to change its role at some point if needed to be
> also a
> > controller or anyway taking part at the quorum by also having the
> metadata
> > topic already replicated.
> >
> > Thanks
> > Paolo
> >
> > On Sun, 24 Mar 2024, 19:05 Sanaa Syed, <sanaa.syed@shopify.com.invalid>
