We have two topics : _left-topic[String, LeftRecord]_=C2=A0and=C2=A0_right-=
topic[String, String]_

where=C2=A0_LeftRecord_=C2=A0:
{code:scala}
=C2=A0case class LeftRecord(foreignKey: String, name: String){code}
we do a simple=C2=A0*INNER* foreign key join on left-topic's foreignKey fie=
ld. The resulting join value is the value in right-topic. (same topology ex=
ample as in KAFKA-16407)

=C2=A0

*Scenario: Unset foreign key of a primary key*
{code:scala}
rightTopic.pipeInput("fk1", "1")

leftTopic.pipeInput("pk1", ProductValue("fk1", "pk1")) leftTopic.pipeInput(=
"pk1", ProductValue(null, "pk1"))
{code}
=C2=A0

