> --transaction.protocol.version=3D2 // Throws error if metadata version is=
 <
> 16, and this would be an upgrade
> But I have updated the KIP to explicitly say the text you mentioned.
>
> Justine
>
> On Wed, Mar 27, 2024 at 1:41=E2=80=AFPM Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa San=
cio
> <jsancio@confluent.io.invalid> wrote:
>
> > Hi Justine,
> >
> > See my comment below.
> >
> > On Wed, Mar 27, 2024 at 1:31=E2=80=AFPM Justine Olshan
> > <jolshan@confluent.io.invalid> wrote:
> > > The feature command includes the upgrade or downgrade command along
> with
> > > the --release-version flag. If some features are not moving in the
