> > > > > > > Ivan, I looked at adding PATCH a while ago as well. I deci=
ded
> > not to
> > > > > > pursue
> > > > > > > the idea for a few reasons:
> > > > > > >
> > > > > > > 1) PATCH is still racy. For example, if you want to add a =
topic
> > to the
