> > > > > > > data source, e.g. Kafka or Zookeeper, and then have your
> > Connector
> > > > > > > subscribe to changes. I've done something like this to ena=
ble
> > dynamic
> > > > > > > reconfiguration of Connectors from command-line tools and
> > dashboards
> > > > > > > without involving the Connect REST API at all. Moreover, I=
've
> > done so in
> > > > > > an
> > > > > > > atomic, non-racy way.
> > > > > > >
> > > > > > > So I don't think PATCH is strictly necessary nor sufficien=
t for
