David Arthur created KAFKA-16446:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Log slow controller events
                 Key: KAFKA-16446
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16446
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: David Arthur


Occasionally, we will see very high p99 controller event processing times. Unless DEBUG logs are enabled, it is impossible to see which events are slow. 

Typically this happens during controller startup/failover, though it can also happen sporadically when the controller gets overloaded.



